### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo User",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Heart Prediction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/predictions/heart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "patientName": "Patient One",
  "gender": "Female",
  "age": 58,
  "bloodPressure": 145,
  "cholesterol": 250,
  "heartRate": 105,
  "chestPain": 2
}

### Diabetes Prediction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/predictions/diabetes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "patientName": "Patient Two",
  "gender": "Male",
  "age": 48,
  "glucose": 145,
  "bmi": 31,
  "insulin": 170,
  "bloodPressure": 142,
  "familyHistory": 1
}

### Liver Disease Prediction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/predictions/liver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "patientName": "Patient Three",
  "gender": "Female",
  "age": 45,
  "bilirubin": 1.6,
  "alkalinePhosphatase": 140,
  "sgpt": 62,
  "sgot": 48,
  "albumin": 3.2
}

### History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### PDF Report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/pdf
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
